2.12. gRPC
gRPC là framework cho phép một chương trình gọi function/service trên một process hoặc server khác thông qua RPC.
 
Ví dụ 1 — gRPC Image Classification
Python Client — client.py
import grpc
import image_pb2
import image_pb2_grpc

channel = grpc.insecure_channel('localhost:50051')
stub = image_pb2_grpc.AIServiceStub(channel)

with open("cat.jpg", "rb") as f:
    img_data = f.read()

response = stub.Inference(
    image_pb2.ImageRequest(image=img_data)
)

print(
    "Result:",
    response.label,
    "confidence:",
    response.confidence
)
C++ AI Server — server.cpp
class AIServiceImpl : public image_pb2_grpc::AIService::Service {

    grpc::Status Inference(
        grpc::ServerContext* context,
        const image_pb2::ImageRequest* request,
        image_pb2::ImageResponse* response) override
    {
        // Xử lý ảnh và chạy mô hình AI
        std::string label = "cat";
        float confidence = 0.98;

        response->set_label(label);
        response->set_confidence(confidence);

        return grpc::Status::OK;
    }
};
Ví dụ 2 — gRPC Text Inference
Python Client — client.py
import grpc
import text_pb2
import text_pb2_grpc

channel = grpc.insecure_channel('localhost:50051')
stub = text_pb2_grpc.TextServiceStub(channel)

